        <h2 id="about-heading">What we are building</h2>
        <p>
          Renova TMS is a new clinic in Surrey Hills, in Melbourne&rsquo;s inner east, sitting alongside an established neurosurgical practice. Our aim is a focused, well run TMS service that treats people with care, measures what it does, and keeps learning.
        </p>
        <p>
          Transcranial magnetic stimulation is a non invasive treatment that uses focused magnetic pulses to stimulate specific areas of the brain. It is an established treatment option, most commonly used for depression that has not responded adequately to standard treatment, and it is delivered under the oversight of a psychiatrist. Whether TMS is suitable for any individual is always a clinical decision, made by a psychiatrist after a proper assessment.
        </p>
        <p>
          We are currently establishing our founding clinical team, our clinical governance and our systems. We will share our opening date, our services and our referral pathways here once they are confirmed.
        </p>
